%% See 04-placement/job-posting-lifecycle.md
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> draft

    draft --> pending_approval: submit<br/>rule_valid · has_window · company_active
    pending_approval --> draft: reject (has_reason)
    draft --> [*]: delete<br/>ONLY from draft, no_applications

    pending_approval --> published: approve+publish ⚠️<br/>rule_valid · has_window<br/>company_active · year_active<br/>▸ FREEZES eligibility_rule

    published --> applications_closed: window_passed<br/>(hourly task)
    published --> in_progress: schedule rounds<br/>(closes window early)
    applications_closed --> in_progress: schedule rounds<br/>round_exists
    in_progress --> completed: no_pending_offers

    draft --> cancelled: cancel ⚠️ (has_reason)
    pending_approval --> cancelled: cancel ⚠️
    published --> cancelled: cancel ⚠️
    applications_closed --> cancelled: cancel ⚠️
    in_progress --> cancelled: cancel ⚠️

    completed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]

    note right of published
        After publish:
          eligibility_rule  — NEVER editable
          closes_at         — extend only
          ctc_lpa           — editable but AUDITED
                              (it feeds is_dream)
          company / kind    — NEVER editable
        Enforced by the DB constraint
        posting_published_has_locked_rule
    end note

    note left of cancelled
        Applications → AUTO_WITHDRAWN
        ISSUED offers → revoked
        ACCEPTED offers → left intact.
        A student who accepted holds a
        commitment; cancelling the posting
        does not undo it.
    end note
